    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dreamed as children of setting up an off-road track on their own desk and conquering it with their favorite vehicle. Now this dream has come true! This game offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of off-road driving right on your desk at a 1:20 scale.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have several off-road vehicles to choose from, each with its own characteristics, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and personalize each off-road vehicle to suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels filled with challenging tests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and a unique simulation system for tire friction against the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics that make you believe it all happens right before your eyes on your desk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Offroad Adventures</strong> is not just a game\u2014it's an exciting adventure that takes your breath away and brings endless joy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many dreamed as children of setting up an off-road track on their own desk and conquering it with their favorite vehicle. Now this dream has come true! This game offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of off-road driving right on your desk at a 1:20 scale.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have several off-road vehicles to choose from, each with its own characteristics, strengths, and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and personalize each off-road vehicle to suit your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels filled with challenging tests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and a unique simulation system for tire friction against the surface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics that make you believe it all happens right before your eyes on your desk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Offroad Adventures</strong> is not just a game\u2014it's an exciting adventure that takes your breath away and brings endless joy!</p>",
    "short_description": "Off-road adventure on your table at a 1:20 scale! Choose your off-road vehicle, customize it, and set out to overcome multiple levels filled with challenging obstacles and tests. Realistic physics, pleasant graphics, and lots of adventures await you!",
